## Plans

Complex work gets an execution plan in `docs/exec-plans/active/`.
Simple tasks (single file, one session): work directly.

**Active plans are created automatically.** When you approve a plan in Claude
Code's plan mode, the `ExitPlanMode` hook writes it to
`docs/exec-plans/active/<slug>.md`. When every checkbox in that plan is marked
`- [x]`, the `Stop` hook moves it to `docs/exec-plans/completed/`. The
`{{PLAN_CMD}}` command is a manual fallback for agents without plan mode.

Completed plans: [docs/exec-plans/completed/](docs/exec-plans/completed/)
